* lna-a5-differential-convert: differential input with single-ended output.
C C4 VIN1 n0
C C5 VIN2 n1
L L1 n0 n2
L L2 n1 n3
NMOS NM1 n2 n4 VSS VSS
NMOS NM2 n3 n5 VSS VSS
C C1 n4 n5
PMOS PM1 n6 n7 VDD VDD
C C2 n7 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n8
NMOS NM3 n8 n8 VSS VSS
R R2 n8 n4
PMOS PM2 n9 n9 VDD VDD
R R4 n9 VSS
R R5 n9 n5